              "location": "328a",
              "context": "συνεσόμεθά τε πολλοῖς τῶν νέων αὐτόθι καὶ διαλεξόμεθα"
            }
          ],
          "observation": "Polemarchus' inducements accumulate: all-night festival, dinner, conversation (διαλεξόμεθα) with young men—a projected evening sequence."
        },
        {
          "id": "republic-chapter-01-section-01:s017",
          "scan_targets": [],
          "features": [
