              "form": "μένετ᾽",
              "lemma": "μένω",
              "location": "327c",
              "context": "ἢ μένετ᾽ αὐτοῦ"
            }
          ],
          "observation": "μένω first appears as one horn of Polemarchus' disjunction (μένετε) and returns as Glaucon's verbal adjective of necessity (μενετέον)."
        }
